{"parse":{"title":"Tycho (lunar crater)","pageid":80045,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"shortdescription nomobile noexcerpt noprint searchaux\" style=\"display:none\">Prominent lunar impact crater</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1358620234\">@media(min-width:640px){.mw-parser-output .infobox{margin-left:1em;float:right;clear:right;width:22em}}.mw-parser-output .infobox-subbox{padding:0;border:none;margin:-3px;width:auto;min-width:100%;font-size:100%;clear:none;float:none;background-color:transparent;color:inherit}.mw-parser-output .infobox-3cols-child{margin:-3px}.mw-parser-output .infobox .navbar{font-size:100%}.mw-parser-output .infobox-hiddenrow,body.skin--responsive.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox .infobox-hiddenrow{display:none}@media screen{html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .infobox-full-data:not(.notheme)>div:not(.notheme)[style]{background:#1f1f23!important;color:#f8f9fa}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .infobox-full-data:not(.notheme)>div:not(.notheme)[style]{background:#1f1f23!important;color:#f8f9fa}}@media(min-width:640px){body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table{display:table!important}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table>caption{display:table-caption!important}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table>tbody{display:table-row-group}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table th,body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table td{padding-left:inherit;padding-right:inherit}}</style><table class=\"infobox\"><caption class=\"infobox-title\">Lunar crater Tycho</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tycho_LRO.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"}\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Tycho_LRO.png/330px-Tycho_LRO.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"330\" height=\"330\" style=\"--mw-file-upright: 1.3\" class=\"mw-file-element mw-file-upright\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Tycho_LRO.png/960px-Tycho_LRO.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1058\" data-file-height=\"1058\" /></a></span><div class=\"infobox-caption\">The crater seen by <a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Reconnaissance_Orbiter\" title=\"Lunar Reconnaissance Orbiter\">Lunar Reconnaissance Orbiter</a> (rotate display if there is a <a href=\"/wiki/Crater_illusion\" title=\"Crater illusion\">crater illusion</a> due to the atypical position of the light source)</div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Location</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Moon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Moon\">The Moon</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Coordinates</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><span class=\"geo-inline\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1156832818\">.mw-parser-output .geo-default,.mw-parser-output .geo-dms,.mw-parser-output .geo-dec{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .geo-nondefault,.mw-parser-output .geo-multi-punct,.mw-parser-output .geo-inline-hidden{display:none}.mw-parser-output .longitude,.mw-parser-output .latitude{white-space:nowrap}</style><span class=\"plainlinks nourlexpansion\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://geohack.toolforge.org/geohack.php?pagename=Tycho_(lunar_crater)&amp;params=43.31_S_11.36_W_globe:moon_type:landmark\"><span class=\"geo-nondefault\"><span class=\"geo-dms\" title=\"Maps, aerial photos, and other data for this location\"><span class=\"latitude\">43°19′S</span> <span class=\"longitude\">11°22′W</span></span></span><span class=\"geo-multi-punct\">&#xfeff; / &#xfeff;</span><span class=\"geo-default\"><span class=\"geo-dec\" title=\"Maps, aerial photos, and other data for this location\">43.31°S 11.36°W</span><span style=\"display:none\">&#xfeff; / <span class=\"geo\">-43.31; -11.36</span></span></span></a></span></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Diameter</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><abbr title=\"circa\">c.</abbr> 85 km</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Depth</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><abbr title=\"circa\">c.</abbr> 4.7&#160;km (2.9&#160;mi)<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Margot99&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Margot99-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Age</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><abbr title=\"circa\">c.</abbr> 108 million years</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Eponym</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tycho_Brahe\" title=\"Tycho Brahe\">Tycho Brahe</a></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Lage_des_Mondkraters_Tycho.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ea/Lage_des_Mondkraters_Tycho.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"150\" data-file-height=\"150\" /></a><figcaption>Location of the crater Tycho as seen from the <a href=\"/wiki/Northern_Hemisphere\" title=\"Northern Hemisphere\">Northern Hemisphere</a></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><span class=\"mw-3d-wrapper\" data-label=\"3D\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tycho.stl\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Tycho.stl/250px-Tycho.stl.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Tycho.stl/500px-Tycho.stl.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"5120\" data-file-height=\"2880\" /></a></span><figcaption>3D model of Tycho</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Tycho</b> (<span class=\"rt-commentedText nowrap\"><span class=\"IPA nopopups noexcerpt\" lang=\"en-fonipa\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help:IPA/English\" title=\"Help:IPA/English\">/<span style=\"border-bottom:1px dotted\"><span title=\"/ˈ/: primary stress follows\">ˈ</span><span title=\"&#39;t&#39; in &#39;tie&#39;\">t</span><span title=\"/aɪ/: &#39;i&#39; in &#39;tide&#39;\">aɪ</span><span title=\"&#39;k&#39; in &#39;kind&#39;\">k</span><span title=\"/oʊ/: &#39;o&#39; in &#39;code&#39;\">oʊ</span></span>/</a></span></span>) is a prominent <a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_craters\" title=\"Lunar craters\">lunar impact</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Impact_crater\" title=\"Impact crater\">crater</a> located in the southern highlands of the <a href=\"/wiki/Moon\" title=\"Moon\">Moon</a>, named after the Danish astronomer <a href=\"/wiki/Tycho_Brahe\" title=\"Tycho Brahe\">Tycho Brahe</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-gpn&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-gpn-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> It is around 108 million years old.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-lro&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-lro-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> It is one of the Moon's brightest craters,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-lro&#95;3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-lro-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> with a diameter of around 85&#160;km (53&#160;mi)<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> and a depth of around 4.7&#160;km (2.9&#160;mi).<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Margot99&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Margot99-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>To the south of Tycho is the crater <a href=\"/wiki/Street_(crater)\" title=\"Street (crater)\">Street</a>, to the east is <a href=\"/wiki/Pictet_(crater)\" title=\"Pictet (crater)\">Pictet</a>, and to the north-northeast is <a href=\"/wiki/Sasserides_(crater)\" title=\"Sasserides (crater)\">Sasserides</a>. The surface around Tycho is replete with craters of various sizes, many overlapping still older craters. Some of the smaller craters are secondary craters formed from larger chunks of <a href=\"/wiki/Ejecta\" title=\"Ejecta\">ejecta</a> from Tycho.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Margot99-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-Margot99_1-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-Margot99_1-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1333433106\">.mw-parser-output cite.citation{font-style:inherit;word-wrap:break-word}.mw-parser-output .citation q{quotes:\"\\\"\"\"\\\"\"\"'\"\"'\"}.mw-parser-output .citation:target{background-color:rgba(0,127,255,0.133)}.mw-parser-output .id-lock-free.id-lock-free a{background:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/65/Lock-green.svg\")right 0.1em center/9px no-repeat}.mw-parser-output .id-lock-limited.id-lock-limited a,.mw-parser-output .id-lock-registration.id-lock-registration a{background:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d6/Lock-gray-alt-2.svg\")right 0.1em center/9px no-repeat}.mw-parser-output .id-lock-subscription.id-lock-subscription a{background:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commo