<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20170330203111/https://www.nasa.gov/mission_pages/LRO/multimedia/lroimages/lroc-20100114-tycho.html\">\"The floor of Tycho crater\"</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Reconnaissance_Orbiter\" title=\"Lunar Reconnaissance Orbiter\">Lunar Reconnaissance Orbiter</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/NASA\" title=\"NASA\">NASA</a>. 3 August 2017. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nasa.gov/mission_pages/LRO/multimedia/lroimages/lroc-20100114-tycho.html\">the original</a> on 30 March 2017<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">1 July</span> 2018</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=The+floor+of+Tycho+crater&amp;rft.series=Lunar+Reconnaissance+Orbiter&amp;rft.pub=NASA&amp;rft.date=2017-08-03&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nasa.gov%2Fmission&#95;pages%2FLRO%2Fmultimedia%2Flroimages%2Flroc-20100114-tycho.html&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ATycho+%28lunar+crater%29\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFWood2006\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Wood, Charles A. (1 August 2006). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.skyandtelescope.com/observing/celestial-objects-to-watch/tycho-the-metropolitan-crater-of-the-moon/\">\"Tycho: The metropolitan crater of the Moon\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Sky_%26_Telescope\" title=\"Sky &amp; Telescope\">Sky &amp; Telescope</a></i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">19 June</sp